#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9441 expect=noViolation domain=TT
#note "Both columns are present (blank on row 2), so both var_exists leaves are false and the sister stays silent - the record-level pair check is the parent CDISC-SEND-0378's job. Together with -violation_no_columns and -noViolation_only_ttenrl_column this pins the sister to EXACTLY the neither-column state."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col TTENRL  type=Char label="Repro Stage End Rule"
col TTDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating | MATING SUCCESS | P14D
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation |  |
